        <attribute name="Name" id="2547" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Cold chain refrigerated transport]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="2548" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Refrigerated transport of a vaccine shipment held at 2 to 8 degrees: reefer pre-trip test and refrigerant repair, setpoint programming and pre-cooling slowed by a heatwave (read arcs), parallel pallet probing, data logger activation and bill of lading set-up, sealed departure, telematics temperature readings with logged excursions capped at three (inhibitor arcs), driver checks for reefer fuel, iced evaporator, door seal and breakdowns with rescue trailers, shore-power overnight stops, quarantine when the excursion budget is exhausted, receipt with logger download and QA stability review, trailer wash-out and a reset of the excursion count (reset arc).]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
      </metadata>
